[[File:Fuku Fire (Beta 7.1).png|thumb|234x234px|Post Beta 7.1]]
Fuku Fire was added in '''Beta 6.6''' with the ability to deal 2 damage to the monster in front of it when placed. However, as a 4G monster, it was outclassed by [[Vulkin]], so its effect was buffed in '''Beta 7.1''' to deal 3 damage, making it far more useful.
[[File:Fuku Fire (Beta 11.0).png|thumb|234x234px|Post Beta 11.0]]
'''Beta 11.0''' gave it -1 ATK, while '''Beta 22.0''' gave it -1 HP, leaving it with 3/2 for 4G.

Stats:

ATK:
* 4 (Post Beta 6.6)
* 3 (Post Beta 11.0, Current)

HP:
* 3 (Post Beta 6.6)
* 2 (Post Beta 22.0, Current)

Cost: 4

Abilities:
* Magic: Deal 2 DMG to the monster in front of it. (Post Beta 6.6)
* Magic: Deal 3 DMG to the monster in front of it. (Post Beta 7.1, Current)
Rarity: White (Common)
